step Downstream and Princess
  tip The Waterlogged Saw, Axe and Toolbox lie in the river south of the bridge. Princess, a big boar, roots in the Brackwell Pumpkin Patch west of the river with her Porcine Entourage: pull the piglets away first. Kill Prowlers and Young Forest Bears on the way. Careful: Croaky is a level 11 elite on the murloc shore. Only go for his head with a group or once you're level 10; otherwise leave him: it's optional.
  collect 247813 quest 91733                  -- Waterlogged Saw
  kill 118 quest 52                           -- Prowler
  kill 822 quest 52                           -- Young Forest Bear
  collect 1006 quest 88                       -- Brass Collar: Princess
  collect 247818 quest 91733                  -- Waterlogged Toolbox
  collect 247817 quest 91733                  -- Waterlogged Axe

