step Taming the Beast
  zone Elwynn Forest
  only Hunter
  tip Josephine Carson stands with the Goldshire trainers. Each of her quests hands you a Taming Rod: use it on the beast she names, then bring the rod back to her. Rockhide Boars and Young Forest Bears roam the hills south of the Maclure Vineyards, Gray Forest Wolves the woods east of Crystal Lake.
