step The Applejack Still
  tip The Applejack Still stands north of the Westbrook Garrison. Click it with four Shiny Red Apples in your bags: it takes them and gives you a Thunder Applejack on the spot (the quest never shows in your quest log). Keep the Applejack for Sergeant De Vries: don't drink it.
  accept 91736 optional                       -- Applejack Still
  turnin 91736 optional
  collect 247824 x1 @24.6,58.0                -- Thunder Applejack, from the still

